# P2K_KEYS script: Save/Copy -> RENAME FLASH SIMM (8 knob steps), cursor right x6 to the ID field,
# ID +2 (106 -> 108), Enter, Enter at "Press ENTER to update Flash SIMM data". Keys: 9 Save/Copy,
# 8 Home/Enter, 12 cursor right (panel bits, docs/p2k-findings.md).
